<title>USA: News Corp signs Prodigy game deal.</title>
<headline>News Corp signs Prodigy game deal.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTESVILLE, Va. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kesmai Corp, a unit of News Corp Ltd, said on Tuesday it agreed to to provide internally developed games and third-party game titles published on the ARIES platform on the Prodigy online service starting this fall.</p>
<p>This agreement makes Kesmai the only game service company to have deals in place with three major commercial online services, the company said.</p>
<p>Kesmai has deals with CompuServe Corp and America Online and internet providers, the company said.</p>
</text>
